I can prove: `le_of_initial_le_no_hM`:
```lean
theorem HeatGridEvolution.le_of_initial_le_no_hM {N : ℕ} {α M : ℝ} (ev : HeatGridEvolution N α)
    (hα0 : 0 ≤ α) (hα1 : α ≤ 1 / 2)
    (hinit : ∀ i ≤ N + 1, ev.u 0 i ≤ M) :
    ∀ t i, i ≤ N + 1 → ev.u t i ≤ M := by
