      (kappaNoncollapsingCertificate_iff_normalizedBallVolumeLowerBound h.kappa_pos h.r0_pos).mp h |>.normalized_lower x r hr hr₀ hK⟩
  · intro h
    exact (kappaNoncollapsingCertificate_iff_normalizedBallVolumeLowerBound h.kappa_pos h.r0_pos).mpr h
```
